{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51511","headline":"{巩/言}光大师草书歌 · 司空图","name":"{巩/言}光大师草书歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羸病爱师书劲逸，翻作长歌助狂笔。\n乘高攂鼓震川原，惊迸骅骝几千匹。\n落笔纵横不离禅，方知草圣本非颠。\n歌成与扫松斋壁，何似曾题《说剑篇》。\n（《六艺之一录》二九○引朱长文《墨池编》十三原书目录作{巩/言}光诗）（《四库全书》本《墨池编》卷四录此诗无作者，附司空图《书屏记》後。\n《宣和书谱》卷九录司空图赠{巩/言}光诗云：「看）（师逸说蹟两相宜，高适歌行李白诗」，此诗中无。\n是砧图作，颇可疑。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}